@startuml
title Web client order creation and SSE updates
hide footbox
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam maxMessageSize 180
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor #2563EB
  LifeLineBorderColor #94A3B8
  ParticipantBorderColor #2563EB
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #EFF6FF
  GroupBorderColor #94A3B8
  GroupBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}
autonumber
actor "User" as U
participant "Browser UI" as W
participant "Node.js web server :5500" as N
participant "Spring Boot API :8080" as A
participant "Browser EventSource" as E
U->W: Open /orders
W->N: GET page and client assets
N-->W: order-creation.html, CSS, JavaScript
U->W: Submit order form
W->W: Disable submit and show Creating order...
W->A: POST /api/v1/create-order (JSON)
alt HTTP or network failure
A ->x W: Error response or failed request
W->W: Show dismissible error toast, enable retry
else Order accepted
A-->W: 202 Accepted + plain-text orderId
W->W: Show success toast and reset form
note over W: Wait 1.8 seconds before navigation
W->N: GET /orders/status?orderId=...
N-->W: order-status.html, CSS, JavaScript
alt Missing orderId in status URL
W->W: Show error, do not open a stream
else orderId present
W->E: Create EventSource, start 20-second timer
E->A: GET /api/v1/event/order-update?orderId=...
alt No open event within 20 seconds
W->E: close()
W->W: Show connection timeout message
else Connection opens
A-->E: Open text/event-stream response
E-->W: open event, clear connection timer
loop Each received order-update event
A-->E: JSON with id, message, timestamp
E-->W: Dispatch named order-update event
W->W: Parse JSON and append update card
U->W: Toggle Show / Hide event details
end
opt Connection interrupted before delivery
E-->W: error with CONNECTING state
W->W: Start one 20-second reconnection timer
E->A: Automatically retry SSE request
note over W,E: Clear timer on open, close stream if timer expires
end
A-->E: Final order-update with delivered message
E-->W: Dispatch final update
W->E: close(), clear connection timer
W->W: Show Order delivered
end
end
end
@enduml
